        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" value="MelbourneFB_DW  --  3 FACT / 6 DIMENSION  (Kimball)&#xa;&#xa;Xanh la = Fact  |  Xanh duong = Dimension&#xa;PK khoa chinh, BK business key, FK khoa ngoai, M measure,&#xa;M* measure KHONG cong duoc (chi AVG/MIN/MAX), DD degenerate dimension&#xa;&#xa;TAI SAO 3 FACT chu khong phai 1:&#xa;Fact 1 grain GIO (1,61 tr dong), Fact 2 grain NAM (13.869 dong).&#xa;Gop lai se nhan ban du lieu nam len 1,6 trieu lan -&gt; sai so cong don.&#xa;Fact 3 tach rieng vi grain co them truc NGANH (20 nganh CLUE);&#xa;neu de 20 nganh thanh 20 cot trong Fact 2 thi vi pham Kimball.&#xa;&#xa;TAI SAO 3 FACT chu khong phai 6:&#xa;Cac nguon CLUE (ghe, patron, viec lam, nha o, giay phep, pipeline)&#xa;deu co CUNG grain block x census year -&gt; gop thanh consolidated&#xa;fact table. Kiem chung: employment-by-block dung 603 dong/nam.&#xa;&#xa;DimBlock la conformed dimension: ca 3 fact deu noi vao no,&#xa;nen Power BI dat measure tu nhieu fact canh nhau khong bi lech.&#xa;&#xa;LUU Y: cot Licence* lay snapshot 30/04/2026 va Pipeline* lay tu&#xa;Development Activity Monitor -- KHONG phai du lieu census.&#xa;Chi dien vao dong IsLatestCensusYear = 1, cac nam khac NULL." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="450" x="260" y="1020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
